== Walkthrough ==

{{expand}}

Open the loom in [[Dionin Needlespin]]'s house and you will find that it opens up into a 12-slot [[Sewing Kit]] complete with Combine button.

You say, 'hail Dionin Needlespin'.

: Dionin Needlespin sets down a needle and thread and a bolt of cloth.
: Dionin says, "Greetings my friend.  I am the tailor of this outpost.  We have limited supplies.  I often have to preserve my tailoring supplies to [mend very large items]."

You say, 'How do you mend very large items?'

:Dionin Needlespin says 'I cannot use a sewing kit to mend items such as ship sail.  I must use my loom outside.  I have the only one available in Kunark, but only I am allowed to use it.  I can't have other breaking it.  I have heard there is an old one in an ancient and ruined library.  I am not sure where it goes from here.'

